  m_Name: Special Type AP-ER Shell Ballistics Profile
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: Special Type AP-ER is a fictional long-range 460 mm armor-piercing
    shell profile. Compared with Type 91 and Type 1 AP, it is modeled with higher
    muzzle velocity, longer maximum range, faster time to target, tighter lateral
    grouping, and worse longitudinal grouping. The ellipse starts strongly stretched
    along range at short distance and becomes rounder with distance while remaining
    more elongated than baseline AP.
  shellType: AP-ER Special Type
  caliberMm: 460
  weightKg: 1460
  projectileLengthCm: 0
  explosiveMassKg: 28
  explosiveType: 
